COMPILATION OF: E48C4

D: Disk Print
L: List Source Program

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 1

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 2

PL/I-80 V1.4 COMPILATION OF: E48C4

   1 a 0000 E48C4:
   2 a 0006   procedure options(main);
   3 a 0006   /* [E2E-48/P2c] THE MEMBER STORE IN CREATE'S CONTEXT, a `do while(^b)' body --
   4 a 0006 exactly E48A12's loop with the member taking `name''s place.
   5 a 0006 E48A12 proved a flat cell keeps the 17-byte form inside a loop; if
   6 a 0006 this object carries the 18-byte XCHG form, position is NOT the
   7 a 0006 discriminator and class is. */
   8 c 0006   dcl
   9 c 0006     1 rec,
  10 c 0006       2 name character(30) varying;
  11 c 0006   dcl b bit(1) static initial('0'b);
  12 c 0006   dcl n fixed bin(15);
  13 c 0006   n = 0;
  14 c 000C   do while(^b);
  15 c 0013      n = n + 1;
  16 c 001A      name = 'AB';
  17 c 0027      b = (name = 'EOF');
  18 c 0039      if n = 4 then b = '1'b;
  19 c 004D   end;
  20 c 004D   put list('N=', n);
  21 c 006F   stop;
  22 a 0072 end E48C4;

CODE SIZE = 0072
DATA AREA = 0029
FREE SYMS = 3840
END  COMPILATION
